// expect: 42
// A MONO caller forward-references a generic callee at a wide instantiation:
// before the heal, the caller's site held the PRE-registered scheme's frozen
// instance (loose vars the callee's later inference never reached), so the
// twin-demand scan read pairs=0 — no twin minted anywhere in the chain — and
// the floor bodies word-read the (Float, Int) pairs: sort compared records by
// ADDRESS and the destructure read an f64 high word as the tag (invalid exit,
// zero diagnostics — the wheel's own render_field chain, SPECPROBE-measured).
// The heal (infer_program's heal_forward_sites) re-unifies every FnScheme
// site against a fresh instance of the FINAL scheme, so the site carries the
// live instantiation and the whole chain twins: rank_first at (Float, Int),
// sort/merge under its bracket, the pattern reads at f64@0 / word@8, and the
// compare fold's f64 leaf ordering the scores.
fn show_rank() = rank_first([(0.5, 30), (2.5, 42), (1.5, 7)])

fn rank_first(pairs) = {
  let (_, tag) = list_index(reverse(sort(pairs)), 0)
  tag
}

fn main() = show_rank()
